{"sections":[{"slug":"群作用","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"群作用"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">群作用</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"群作用"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">生象群与一般范畴的对象</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">与范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的作用为函子</span> $\\mathbf{B}G\\to\\mathcal C$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当然</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的对象也有类似概念</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">一般范畴中的群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $G$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nX /\\!\\!/ G = (\\cdots X\\times G\\times G \\to^3 X\\times G \\rightrightarrows X )\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">以及态射</span>\n$$\r\nX /\\!\\!/ G \\to * /\\!\\!/ G.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">意象中的群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的作用等同于指向</span> $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C_{/ \\mathbf{B}G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">而由意象的下降性质有</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal C_{/\\mathbf{B}G} \\simeq \\operatorname{lim}\\Big(\r\n\\mathcal C \\rightrightarrows \\mathcal C_{/G} \\to^3 \\mathcal C_{/G\\times G}\\cdots\r\n\\Big),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">于是</span> $\\mathcal C_{/\\mathbf{B}G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象等同于单纯对象</span>\n$$\r\nX /\\!\\!/ G = (\\cdots X\\times G\\times G \\to^3 X\\times G \\rightrightarrows X ).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">生象群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">在生象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的作用的</span><strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/不动点","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">不动点</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\nX^G := \\operatorname{lim}_{\\mathbf{B}G}X = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}_{/\\mathbf{B}G}}(\\mathbf{B}G,X/G);\r\n$$\n<strong><span lang=\"zh\">余不动点</span></strong> (<span lang=\"zh\">即群作用的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">商</span></strong>) <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\nX_G := \\operatorname{colim}_{\\mathbf{B}G}X = X/G= \\operatorname{colim} X /\\!\\!/ G,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n(\\cdots X\\times G\\times G \\to^3 X\\times G \\rightrightarrows X )\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">群在自身上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/共轭作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">共轭作用</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对位置","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对位置</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}